note.p:
Ordinance of the senate of Hamburg. April 26, 1854; ordnance of the senate of
                    Lubec, April 28, 1854; of Lubec of the same date; government of Oldenburg, April
                    20, 1854; the King of Sweden, April 8; Denmark, April 20; Mecklenburg. April 26;
                    Hanover, May 5; the two Sicilies. May 17; Tuscany, June 3; Belgium, April 25;
                    Sandwich Islands, July 17, 1854.
